lawful actions, and the importance of fulfilling commitments. It contains important guidance for believers regarding moral conduct, community responsibility, and obedience to Allah.", "short_description": "Surah Al-Ma'idah highlights themes of faithfulness, justice, lawful and unlawful actions, and the importance of fulfilling commitments. It contains important guidance for believers regarding moral conduct, community responsibility, and obedience to Allah."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34125982300378658"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823271_2142833093149664_2149756515084680674_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jqWGs3cFsOoQ7kNvwHos0n_&_nc_oc=AdrAQ5N92kWD9wqdw0Fx79nkJrdcq_-SB3L9O3Xvnw8K_OXDWASDryzo00dttrz6e0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQlX7yd36Uljpt7ZX4sj8FstTnHmNSdxUIG2MmpqVSGbg&oe=6B006B96"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "disp